    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Write $(a-b)^n=(a+(-b))^n$. Even powers of $-b$ give positive signs and odd powers give negative signs.",
      "worked": "Write $(a-b)^n=(a+(-b))^n$. The powers of $-b$ increase successively from $0$ to $n$. Even powers give positive signs and odd powers give negative signs, so the signs alternate.",
